WEBVTT

00:09:26.563 --> 00:09:30.213
very fast, very low, and so loud

00:09:30.237 --> 00:09:33.079
that the anthrophony, the human noise,

00:09:33.103 --> 00:09:35.103
even though it's six and a half kilometers

00:09:35.127 --> 00:09:37.903
from the frog pond you
just heard a second ago,

00:09:37.927 --> 00:09:41.469
it masked the sound
of the chorusing toads.

00:09:41.493 --> 00:09:44.735
You can see in this spectrogram
that all of the energy

00:09:44.759 --> 00:09:47.482
that was once in the first
spectrogram is gone

00:09:47.506 --> 00:09:49.229
from the top end of the spectrogram,

00:09:49.253 --> 00:09:52.063
and that there's breaks
in the chorusing at two and a half,

00:09:52.087 --> 00:09:54.255
four and a half,
and six and a half seconds,

00:09:54.279 --> 00:09:57.354
and then the sound
of the jet, the signature,

00:09:57.378 --> 00:09:59.913
is in yellow at the very
bottom of the page.

00:09:59.937 --> 00:10:09.558
(Frogs croaking)